WEBVTT

00:11:59.421 --> 00:12:00.739
It hardly mattered.

00:12:00.763 --> 00:12:06.563
As you recall, many people had filed out
before even the first point was concluded.

00:12:07.437 --> 00:12:09.942
The only thing that saved him

00:12:09.966 --> 00:12:12.087
was the fact that he took part.

00:12:13.464 --> 00:12:15.833
The best way to win any game,

00:12:15.857 --> 00:12:18.651
Japan tells me every other night,

00:12:18.675 --> 00:12:23.870
is never, never to think about the score.

00:12:25.365 --> 00:12:26.516
Thank you.

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:29.986
(Applause)